What is a URL Shortener : 
    A URL shortener converts a long URL into a short, compact URL.

    Example:
        Original URL:
            https://www.amazon.in/gp/product/B0XYZ123456789?ref=something-long
        
        Short URL:
            https://bit.ly/abc123

Why do we need URL Shorteners
    Easy to share
    Tracking & Analytics
    Branding








